# Upstream flight-control sources (see docs/FLIGHT_CORPUS.md). Never vendored: they are
# large, they carry their own licences (PX4 BSD-3, ArduPilot GPLv3), and mixing GPLv3 source
# into this tree would infect what we ship. Clone them OUTSIDE the repo and point the
# harvester at them; only the derived task JSONL is ever considered for check-in.
vendor/
third_party/
px4-autopilot/
ardupilot/
data/flight/
tasks/flight_*.jsonl
